{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elf, dwarf, Beastfolk, Dragonfolk... and even humans. Adventurers of all kinds gather at \u300eGalvatein: Adventurer\u2019s Guild\u300f, located in the heart of the continent of Eustass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300eGalvatein: Adventurer\u2019s Guild\u300f is a fantasy simulation game where you take on the role of a guild receptionist, verify quests submitted by adventurers. The game unfolds in an omnibus format, with each chapter presenting a unique tale set in a classic fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the day, you\u2019ll interact with adventurers of various races and verify their quests.<br>At night, you\u2019ll head to the guild tavern to cook &quot;monster dishes&quot; using loot gathered from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll face many choices \u2014 each one shaping your story, unlocking multiple endings and special events based on the path you take.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208930?t=1744190111","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208930?t=1744190111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/951fa66a17ca9aedaafebf3b070760218695cd25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744190111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/951fa66a17ca9aedaafebf3b070760218695cd25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744190111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elf, dwarf, Beastfolk, Dragonfolk... and even humans. Adventurers of all kinds gather at \u300eGalvatein: Adventurer\u2019s Guild\u300f, located in the heart of the continent of Eustass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300eGalvatein: Adventurer\u2019s Guild\u300f is a fantasy simulation game where you take on the role of a guild receptionist, verify quests submitted by adventurers. The game unfolds in an omnibus format, with each chapter presenting a unique tale set in a classic fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the day, you\u2019ll interact with adventurers of various races and verify their quests.<br>At night, you\u2019ll head to the guild tavern to cook &quot;monster dishes&quot; using loot gathered from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll face many choices \u2014 each one shaping your story, unlocking multiple endings and special events based on the path you take.</p>","developers":["BLANBEE"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208930/b18fc3482ca7c28485f6ef0173fc16f0875db0b2/header.jpg?t=1744190111","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123954,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123954/movie480.mp4?t=1744190108","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123954/movie_max.mp4?t=1744190108"},"name":"Galvatein Adventurer's Guild | Game Play","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123954/540024e84f95eafbd82df74d85810d112bdb2763/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744190108","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123954/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744190108","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123954/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744190108"}}],"name":"\uac08\ubc14\ud14c\uc778 : \ubaa8\ud5d8\uac00 \uae38\ub4dc \uc0ac\ubb34\uc18c","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":